flowchart LR

IN["`◀ from 1, 2 and 4 · every process`"]

STD["`stdout · single-line JSON`"]
STD_N["`no files, no rotation
a container should not know Loki exists`"]
STD -.- STD_N
PTL["`Promtail`"]
PTL_N["`discovers containers via the Docker socket
a new service is collected with zero config`"]
PTL -.- PTL_N
LOK["`Loki · logs`"]
LOK_N["`query by any JSON field
{container=...} | json | user_email=...`"]
LOK -.- LOK_N

MET["`/metrics`"]
MET_N["`rate, latency, status per route
plus the three the HTTP layer cannot see:
dependency_up, celery_queue_depth,
llm_requests_total by provider and outcome
exported because an alert watches them`"]
MET -.- MET_N
NEX["`node-exporter`"]
NEX_N["`host CPU, memory, disk, network
is the app slow or is the box dying`"]
NEX -.- NEX_N
PRM["`Prometheus :9090`"]
PRM_N["`scrapes /metrics, NOT /ready
readiness is for the orchestrator,
metrics is for monitoring
12 alert rules + SLO recording rules
CI validates the rule files: a broken one
starts Prometheus with no alerts, silently`"]
PRM -.- PRM_N

OTL["`OpenTelemetry`"]
OTL_N["`opt-in · auto-instruments FastAPI,
SQLAlchemy, Redis, httpx and Celery
context propagates through the Redis broker`"]
OTL -.- OTL_N
OTC["`OTel Collector`"]
OTC_N["`code talks OTLP to this, never to Tempo
changing backend is one container config`"]
OTC -.- OTC_N
TMP["`Tempo · traces`"]
TMP_N["`no UI of its own, not published to the host
Grafana is the only window`"]
TMP -.- TMP_N

GRF["`Grafana :3000`"]
GRF_N["`three datasources, provisioned as code
every panel backs an alert rule;
a panel that pages nobody is decoration
the payoff: a log line carries trace_id,
so one signal hands you to the next
93% of ingestion was the embedding call,
a number no aggregate metric would give`"]
GRF -.- GRF_N

ALM["`Alertmanager :9093`"]
ALM_N["`groups, inhibits symptoms of a known cause
runbook annotation on every rule
Watchdog always fires: its silence is the signal
receiver not wired yet: alerts stop at the UI`"]
ALM -.- ALM_N

SLO["`SLOs`"]
SLO_N["`alerts answer IS IT UP
SLOs answer IS IT KEEPING ITS PROMISE
99% without 5xx · 95% under 500ms
95% of plans drafted under 2 min
under 5% of draftings fail · 30-day window
an objective is useful only if it can be missed`"]
SLO -.- SLO_N

IN ==> STD
IN ==> MET
IN ==> OTL
STD --> PTL --> LOK --> GRF
MET --> PRM
NEX --> PRM
PRM --> GRF
OTL --> OTC --> TMP --> GRF
PRM -->|"fired"| ALM
PRM --- SLO

